e_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/ebb3e40deb4e232bf44ed938de1665a1.mp4?t=1773891709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategically fill your cargo before setting sail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the world, you\u2019ll build up a permanent inventory of treasures and trinkets, but you can\u2019t bring them all with you on voyages. Before setting sail, fill your limited cargo slots with artefacts, consumables or coins. Experiment with different starter item combos to give your next voyage a boost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/26e83de38e21cc5237c91927b148e7f0.poster.avif?t=1773891709\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/26e83de38e21cc5237c91927b148e7f0.webm?t=1773891709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/26e83de38e21cc5237c91927b148e7f0.mp4?t=1773891709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get loot or die trying!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hundreds of cards to build your deck, and plunder powerful artefacts. Upon death you\u2019ll have to bargain your way back from Davy\u2019s locker and start over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/d2c0c94f97c73fa26bb43299ed783e3a.poster.avif?t=1773891709\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/d2c0c94f97c73fa26bb43299ed783e3a.webm?